      "status": "answered",
      "quote": "Behaviour-crisis notes: they go in the org's own private space, for the Board alone. Whoever runs the host can read them until sensitive documents exist (\"Later\"), and whoever runs Spell's servers can read them even then, so RS should know that, or keep them elsewhere.\nThe recovery key: whoever leaves holding it holds the group's identity, so more than one person should. How the protocol does that is unchecked.",
